Read `docs/MVP.md` before feature work. The course MVP is the protected baseline.
Read `docs/IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md` for every non-trivial implementation task and
obey its next checkpoint, target semantics, scope and status-update protocol.
For accounts, authorization, rooms or billing, also read `docs/ROOM-BOOKING.md`
and follow its ordered slices. `docs/PRODUCT-VISION.md` is broader context, not
blanket scope. Preserve guest course checkout. FR/DE/EN and mobile are mandatory.
Do not add unrelated student-lifecycle or post-launch room features unless asked.
